{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れさま♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は横浜全国握手会でした☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さったみなさん、ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/11/03/2492182/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46のイベント初参加です。」という方がたくさんいらして下さいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに多くの方々に応援して頂いている、乃木坂46メンバーの1人であることを改めて幸せに感じた1日だったなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/11/03/2492182/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまいやんファンの皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日1日お世話になりました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんとっても優しくして下さって、嬉しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつかお会いできたら幸せです(*´˘`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さってありがとうございました*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーから、ひなちまふぁみりーさんは「穏やかで優しい方ばかりだね。」って言ってもらえることが沢山あります。ひなもそう思う...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーさんは本当にあたたかくて、大好きです(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなの自慢です*＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からひなちまふぁみりーになっても良いですかっと言って下さる方もたくさんで、嬉しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大歓迎ですよ\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、宜しくお願いします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日来られなかったひなちまふぁみりーさんへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はまいやんと一緒のレーンで、髪型はゆる巻で編み込んでもらったよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/11/03/2492182/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、朝ご飯を食べる時にあみがお箸を持ってこようと席を立ったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、帰ってきたらあみの手にはスプーンが2本。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/11/03/2492182/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あれ...？あみ...？お箸は...？笑」とひなが聞いたら、「あぁ～！！間違えた！」だって(   ´･ω･`   )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでお箸1膳とスプーン2本を間違えちゃうの～⁈⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、たくさん笑っちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から笑顔いっぱいだったよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、握手会終了後に川後のひなさんがデレデレしてきてくれたの♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しいし、嬉しくて、思わず「ちょっとストップ！！この状態から動かないでね！！」ってひなぴょんに言って、まあやに写真撮ってもらった♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/11/03/2492182/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日あっという間だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せな日だったなあ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からも学校頑張ろっと(*´˘`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/11/03/2492182/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【 11月3日 あつやんさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【 11月4日 まさ験さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に'･:*☆♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もみなさんにとって幸せであります様に☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"}